| !Boot for !ReelEGL (Reel drawing through EGL, from riscos-ffmpeg)
If "<ReelEGL$Dir>"="" Then Set ReelEGL$Dir <Obey$Dir>
| *ReelEGL <a video, or a web address> plays it: for a command line, or another
| program handing it a stream (as for mplayer and ffplay)
SetMacro Alias$ReelEGL /<ReelEGL$Dir> %%*0
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
| The file types a double-click opens with ReelEGL even when it isn't loaded
| (ticked in File types on its icon bar menu)
IfThere Choices:ReelEGL.Types Then Obey Choices:ReelEGL.Types
